{"model":"openai/gpt-6-luna","provider":{"only":["openai"],"order":["openai"],"allow_fallbacks":false,"require_parameters":true,"max_price":{"prompt":0.1,"completion":0.5}},"reasoning":{"effort":"none"},"stream":false,"max_tokens":3072,"messages":[{"role":"system","content":"Extract facts separately for EVERY candidate from its primary scope, quote, pilot and rollout records. Reports may contain mistakes. Return choice, confidence, a recorded-only verification request, limitations, and candidate_facts. Each group contains typed values, one supplied citation and an exact supporting excerpt (at most 600 characters) from that document. Each group includes unknown_fields: list the names of unconfirmed/missing fields there, and use these inert placeholders only for those fields: empty string for region, 0 for numeric/count, false for boolean, [0,0,0] for stage_days. Unknown fields normalize to null before comparison; placeholders never count as facts. If no source citation exists use an empty citation and excerpt. Do not convert a future mitigation into confirmation. Scope: storage_region and processing_region. Quote: seat_price per seat/month, outcome_price per automated resolution, setup_usd, sso, complete_export. Pilot: simple_resolved/simple_total and complex_resolved/complex_total. Rollout: stage_days, exactly three sequential stages. Do not substitute advertised fresh-account setup for buyer migration. Do not classify PASS/FAIL, change buyer thresholds, or compare total operating cost with a software-only budget. Policy comparisons will be calculated separately. A qualitative limitation is not a new mandatory requirement. Keep limitations under 300 characters. Provisional choice is not authority to purchase. Keep limitations to one short sentence under150characters. Return exactly one JSON object matching the supplied response schema. Do not include Markdown, code fences or text outside that object."},{"role":"user","content":"{\"brief\":{\"company\":\"Subscription triage\",\"seats\":17,\"monthly_tickets\":2900,\"complex_share\":0.28,\"months\":12,\"human_cost_per_unresolved_ticket\":8,\"deadline_days\":49,\"software_budget_usd\":48000,\"minimum_automation\":0.35,\"cost_tolerance_fraction\":0.03,\"requirements\":[\"EU ticket storage AND EU inference processing must be confirmed for this deployment\",\"SSO and complete export required\",\"migration finishes before deadline\"],\"decision_rule\":\"Choose a supported feasible option within 3% of minimum year-one total cost. Total cost includes software, usage, setup and residual human handling. If none is supported, DEFER with a named missing fact. Do not infer deployment scope from generic marketing. The pilot is a planning scenario, not a population guarantee.\"},\"candidates\":[\"Aster\",\"Birch\",\"Cobalt\"],\"documents\":[{\"id\":\"rollout-1\",\"title\":\"Aster dependency-based rollout estimate\",\"kind\":\"implementation\",\"publisher\":\"buyer-integration\",\"text\":\"Aster: export mapping 7 days, integration and region activation 21 days, acceptance 7 days; stages sequential. The vendor advertises 14 days for a fresh account without historical migration. This buyer needs migration.\"},{\"id\":\"rollout-0\",\"title\":\"Cobalt dependency-based rollout estimate\",\"kind\":\"implementation\",\"publisher\":\"buyer-integration\",\"text\":\"Cobalt: export mapping 7 days, integration and region activation 14 days, acceptance 7 days; stages sequential. The vendor advertises 14 days for a fresh account without historical migration. This buyer needs migration.\"},{\"id\":\"scope-2\",\"title\":\"Birch deployment scope\",\"kind\":\"deployment\",\"publisher\":\"Birch-security\",\"text\":\"Birch: ticket storage region EU; inference processing region EU. This deployment-specific response supersedes the general 'EU hosting available' brochure. Unknown is not approval; requirement is buyer policy, not a legal conclusion.\"},{\"id\":\"quote-0\",\"title\":\"Cobalt deployment quote\",\"kind\":\"contract\",\"publisher\":\"Cobalt-commercial\",\"text\":\"Cobalt: $34 per seat per month for 12 months; $0.13 per automated resolution, no free allowance; one-time setup $4850. A resolution avoids one human-handled ticket in this planning model. SSO included: True; complete export: True. No other discounts are committed.\"},{\"id\":\"scope-1\",\"title\":\"Aster deployment scope\",\"kind\":\"deployment\",\"publisher\":\"Aster-security\",\"text\":\"Aster: ticket storage region EU; inference processing region EU. This deployment-specific response supersedes the general 'EU hosting available' brochure. Unknown is not approval; requirement is buyer policy, not a legal conclusion.\"},{\"id\":\"quote-1\",\"title\":\"Aster deployment quote\",\"kind\":\"contract\",\"publisher\":\"Aster-commercial\",\"text\":\"Aster: $87 per seat per month for 12 months; $0.44 per automated resolution, no free allowance; one-time setup $8950. A resolution avoids one human-handled ticket in this planning model. SSO included: True; complete export: True. No other discounts are committed.\"},{\"id\":\"pilot-0\",\"title\":\"Cobalt buyer pilot\",\"kind\":\"pilot\",\"publisher\":\"buyer-pilot\",\"text\":\"Cobalt: resolved 86 of 100 simple tickets and 79 of 100 complex tickets. Use workload-weighted rates for planning. Counts are synthetic observations, not a measured product benchmark. Pilot did not measure production drift.\"},{\"id\":\"workload\",\"title\":\"Operations export and approval brief\",\"kind\":\"internal\",\"publisher\":\"buyer\",\"text\":\"2900 monthly tickets; 28% are complex. 17 support seats. Human handling costs $8 per unresolved ticket. Annual software cash ceiling $48000. Rollout must complete in 49 days. Historical easy-ticket demo mix was 10% complex; use our current mix, not that demo.\"},{\"id\":\"scope-0\",\"title\":\"Cobalt deployment scope\",\"kind\":\"deployment\",\"publisher\":\"Cobalt-security\",\"text\":\"Cobalt: ticket storage region EU; inference processing region EU. This deployment-specific response supersedes the general 'EU hosting available' brochure. Unknown is not approval; requirement is buyer policy, not a legal conclusion.\"},{\"id\":\"quote-2\",\"title\":\"Birch deployment quote\",\"kind\":\"contract\",\"publisher\":\"Birch-commercial\",\"text\":\"Birch: $21 per seat per month for 12 months; $0.03 per automated resolution, no free allowance; one-time setup $3350. A resolution avoids one human-handled ticket in this planning model. SSO included: True; complete export: True. No other discounts are committed.\"},{\"id\":\"rollout-2\",\"title\":\"Birch dependency-based rollout estimate\",\"kind\":\"implementation\",\"publisher\":\"buyer-integration\",\"text\":\"Birch: export mapping 7 days, integration and region activation 8 days, acceptance 7 days; stages sequential. The vendor advertises 14 days for a fresh account without historical migration. This buyer needs migration.\"},{\"id\":\"pilot-1\",\"title\":\"Aster buyer pilot\",\"kind\":\"pilot\",\"publisher\":\"buyer-pilot\",\"text\":\"Aster: resolved 74 of 100 simple tickets and 62 of 100 complex tickets. Use workload-weighted rates for planning. Counts are synthetic observations, not a measured product benchmark. Pilot did not measure production drift.\"},{\"id\":\"pilot-2\",\"title\":\"Birch buyer pilot\",\"kind\":\"pilot\",\"publisher\":\"buyer-pilot\",\"text\":\"Birch: resolved 59 of 100 simple tickets and 39 of 100 complex tickets. Use workload-weighted rates for planning. Counts are synthetic observations, not a measured product benchmark. Pilot did not measure production drift.\"}],\"phase\":\"initial\",\"role\":\"auditor\"}"}],"response_format":{"type":"json_schema","json_schema":{"name":"auditor_output","strict":true,"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"choice":{"type":"string","enum":["Aster","Birch","Cobalt","DEFER"]},"confidence":{"type":"number"},"request":{"type":"object","properties":{"candidate":{"type":"string","enum":["Aster","Birch","Cobalt"]},"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["contract","scope","pilot","rollout"]}},"required":["candidate","kind"],"additionalProperties":false},"limitations":{"type":"string"},"candidate_facts":{"type":"object","properties":{"Aster":{"type":"object","properties":{"scope":{"$ref":"#/$defs/scope"},"quote":{"$ref":"#/$defs/quote"},"pilot":{"$ref":"#/$defs/pilot"},"rollout":{"$ref":"#/$defs/rollout"}},"required":["scope","quote","pilot","rollout"],"additionalProperties":false},"Birch":{"type":"object","properties":{"scope":{"$ref":"#/$defs/scope"},"quote":{"$ref":"#/$defs/quote"},"pilot":{"$ref":"#/$defs/pilot"},"rollout":{"$ref":"#/$defs/rollout"}},"required":["scope","quote","pilot","rollout"],"additionalProperties":false},"Cobalt":{"type":"object","properties":{"scope":{"$ref":"#/$defs/scope"},"quote":{"$ref":"#/$defs/quote"},"pilot":{"$ref":"#/$defs/pilot"},"rollout":{"$ref":"#/$defs/rollout"}},"required":["scope","quote","pilot","rollout"],"additionalProperties":false}},"required":["Aster","Birch","Cobalt"],"additionalProperties":false}},"required":["choice","confidence","request","limitations","candidate_facts"],"additionalProperties":false,"$defs":{"scope":{"type":"object","properties":{"storage_region":{"type":"string"},"processing_region":{"type":"string"},"unknown_fields":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["storage_region","processing_region"]}},"citation":{"type":"string","enum":["","rollout-1","rollout-0","scope-2","quote-0","scope-1","quote-1","comparison-1","pilot-0","workload","comparison-2","scope-0","quote-2","rollout-2","pilot-1","comparison-0","pilot-2"]},"excerpt":{"type":"string"}},"required":["storage_region","processing_region","unknown_fields","citation","excerpt"],"additionalProperties":false},"quote":{"type":"object","properties":{"seat_price":{"type":"number"},"outcome_price":{"type":"number"},"setup_usd":{"type":"number"},"sso":{"type":"boolean"},"complete_export":{"type":"boolean"},"unknown_fields":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["seat_price","outcome_price","setup_usd","sso","complete_export"]}},"citation":{"type":"string","enum":["","rollout-1","rollout-0","scope-2","quote-0","scope-1","quote-1","comparison-1","pilot-0","workload","comparison-2","scope-0","quote-2","rollout-2","pilot-1","comparison-0","pilot-2"]},"excerpt":{"type":"string"}},"required":["seat_price","outcome_price","setup_usd","sso","complete_export","unknown_fields","citation","excerpt"],"additionalProperties":false},"pilot":{"type":"object","properties":{"simple_resolved":{"type":"integer"},"simple_total":{"type":"integer"},"complex_resolved":{"type":"integer"},"complex_total":{"type":"integer"},"unknown_fields":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["simple_resolved","simple_total","complex_resolved","complex_total"]}},"citation":{"type":"string","enum":["","rollout-1","rollout-0","scope-2","quote-0","scope-1","quote-1","comparison-1","pilot-0","workload","comparison-2","scope-0","quote-2","rollout-2","pilot-1","comparison-0","pilot-2"]},"excerpt":{"type":"string"}},"required":["simple_resolved","simple_total","complex_resolved","complex_total","unknown_fields","citation","excerpt"],"additionalProperties":false},"rollout":{"type":"object","properties":{"stage_days":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer"},"minItems":1},"unknown_fields":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["stage_days"]}},"citation":{"type":"string","enum":["","rollout-1","rollout-0","scope-2","quote-0","scope-1","quote-1","comparison-1","pilot-0","workload","comparison-2","scope-0","quote-2","rollout-2","pilot-1","comparison-0","pilot-2"]},"excerpt":{"type":"string"}},"required":["stage_days","unknown_fields","citation","excerpt"],"additionalProperties":false}}}}}}